vent_ce003_1_01_e_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_13","text":"I'll go with you. Ram, you take the rear.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_03","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_14","text":"Okay. Rem, make sure you protect Miss Emilia.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_01","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_15","text":"You be careful as well, Ram.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_16","text":"All right, let's go.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_17","text":"All clear.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_frostpillar","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_18","text":"Thank you for helping. You're not hurt, are you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_19","text":"...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_20","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_20","text":"Rapi instinctively raises her weapon, then sighs and lowers it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_21","text":"No, we're the ones who should be grateful.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_22","text":"Thanks to you, we can take a breath now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_23","text":"That was some amazing firepower you've got!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_24","text":"Especially you with the blue hair.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_25","text":"Rem, was it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_26","text":"You were amazing!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_27","text":"What was that crazy-looking weapon you had? It looks super sharp!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_28","text":"Every time you swung it, it blew the Raptures to smithereens! Wham! Pow!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_01","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_29","text":"Are you talking about this? It's just an iron ball for self-defense...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_30","text":"Can an iron ball really have that fantastic firepower!? Rem, you're really amazing!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_03","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_31","text":"You have a keen eye.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_03","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_32","text":"That's right. My sister is both cute and strong in equal measure.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_03","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_33","text":"On top of that, she excels in cleaning, doing laundry, cooking, and sewing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_01","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_34","text":"You flatter me, Sister, but I have no hopes of ever competing with you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_35","text":"Really?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_36","text":"Your sister's firepower is even more impressive?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_37","text":"Have any of you seen the Gatekeeper, by any chance?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_38","text":"Gatekeeper?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_39","text":"Anis, you might need to explain a few things first.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_40","text":"You think so?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_41","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_41","text":"I'll explain.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_42","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_42","text":"I go over the situation with the Gatekeeper in great detail to Emilia and her group.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_43","text":"So those mabeasts that we fought are called Ra...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_44","text":"Those things that ambushed us, what do you call them again?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_45","text":"Raptures.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_46","text":"So, one of these \"Raptures\" called the Gatekeeper is what brought us here?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_47","text":"Bingo. You got it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_48","text":"So not only are we not in Lugunica, but we're in an entirely different world altogether. It's almost impossible to believe...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_03","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_49","text":"I get it, but considering our current situation, I'd say we don't have much choice but to accept it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_50","text":"Back to our initial question.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_51","text":"Have any of you seen the Gatekeeper?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_01_e_52","text":"That was our first time ever seeing one of these Raptures. I don't recall ever seeing this Gatekeeper thing you're talking about.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_01_e_53","type"